     2051                                     , output v-uniq-key-rec).
     2052   find first buf_ext-classif no-lock
     2053        where buf_ext-classif.uniq-key-rec    = v-uniq-key-rec
     2054          and buf_ext-classif.classif-subject = 'clients':U
     2055          and buf_ext-classif.classif-name    = 'clients-edoc-nn':U
     2056          no-error.
     2057   if available buf_ext-classif then do :
